"ກະລຸນາລໍຖ້າ...<br></p>\n"

#. Read dialog help 2/2
#: src/include/slp-server/helps.rb:21
msgid ""
"<p><b><big>Aborting Initialization:</big></b><br>\n"
"Safely abort the configuration utility by pressing <b>Abort</b> now.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p><b><big>ຍົກເລີກການເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ:</big></b><br>\n"
"ຍົກເລີກເຄື່ອງມືການຕັ້ງຄ່າຢ່າງປອດໄພໂດຍການກົດ <b>ຍົກເລີກ</b> ດຽວນີ້.</p>\n"

#. Write dialog help 1/2
#: src/include/slp-server/helps.rb:25
msgid ""
"<p><b><big>Saving SLP Server Configuration</big></b><br>\n"
"Please wait...<br></p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p><b><big>ກຳລັງບັນທຶກການຕັ້ງຄ່າເຊີເວີ SLP</big></b><br>\n"
"ກະລຸນາລໍຖ້າ...<br></p>\n"

#. Write dialog help 2/2
#: src/include/slp-server/helps.rb:29
msgid ""
"<p><b><big>Aborting Saving:</big></b><br>\n"
"Abort the save procedure by pressing <b>Abort</b>.\n"
"An additional dialog informs whether it is safe to do so.\n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p><b><big>ຍົກເລີກການບັນທຶກ:</big></b><br>\n"
"ຍົກເລີກຂັ້ນຕອນການບັນທຶກໂດຍການກົດ <b>ຍົກເລີກ</b>.\n"
"ຈະມີກ່ອງໂຕ້ຕອບແຈ້ງເຕືອນຕື່ມອີກວ່າ ມັນປອດໄພທີ່ຈະເຮັດແນວນັ້ນຫຼືບໍ່.\n"
"</p>\n"

#. Ovreview dialog help 1/3
#: src/include/slp-server/helps.rb:36
msgid ""
"<p><b><big>SLP Server Configuration Overview</big></b><br>\n"
"Obtain an overview of installed SLP servers. Additionally\n"
"edit their configurations.<br></p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p><b><big>ພາບລວມການຕັ້ງຄ່າເຊີເວີ SLP</big></b><br>\n"
"ເບິ່ງພາບລວມຂອງເຊີເວີ SLP ທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງໄວ້. ນອກຈາກນັ້ນ\n"
"ຍັງສາມາດແກ້ໄຂການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອງພວກມັນໄດ້.<br></p>\n"

#. Ovreview dialog help 2/3
#: src/include/slp-server/helps.rb:42
msgid ""
"<p><b><big>Adding an SLP Server</big></b><br>\n"
"Press <b>Add</b> to configure an SLP server.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p><b><big>ເພີ່ມເຊີເວີ SLP</big></b><br>\n"
"ກົດ <b>ເພີ່ມ</b> ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າເຊີເວີ SLP.</p>\n"

#. Ovreview dialog help 3/3
#: src/include/slp-server/helps.rb:46
msgid ""
"<p><b><big>Editing or Deleting</big></b><br>\n"
"Choose an SLP server to change or remove.\n"
"Then press <b>Edit</b> or <b>Delete</b> as desired.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p><b><big>ການແກ້ໄຂ ຫຼື ການລຶບ</big></b><br>\n"
"ເລືອກເຊີເວີ SLP ທີ່ຕ້ອງການປ່ຽນແປງ ຫຼື ເອົາອອກ.\n"
"ຈາກນັ້ນກົດ <b>ແກ້ໄຂ</b> ຫຼື <b>ລຶບ</b> ຕາມທີ່ຕ້ອງການ.</p>\n"

#. Configure1 dialog help 1/2
#: src/include/slp-server/helps.rb:52
msgid ""
"<p><b><big>Configuration Part One</big></b><br>\n"
"Press <b>Next</b> to continue.\n"
"<br></p>"
msgstr ""
"<p><b><big>ການຕັ້ງຄ່າພາກທີໜຶ່ງ</big></b><br>\n"
"ກົດ <b>ຖັດໄປ</b> ເພື່ອດຳເນີນການຕໍ່.\n"
"<br></p>"

#. Configure1 dialog help 2/2
#. Configure2 dialog help 2/2
#: src/include/slp-server/helps.rb:58 src/include/slp-server/helps.rb:70
msgid ""
"<p><b><big>Selecting Something</big></b><br>\n"
"It is not possible. You must code it first. :-)\n"
"</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p><b><big>ການເລືອກບາງສິ່ງ</big></b><br>\n"
"ມັນບໍ່ສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້. ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງຂຽນໂຄ້ດມັນກ່ອນ. :-)\n"
"</p>"

#. Configure2 dialog help 1/2
#: src/include/slp-server/helps.rb:64
msgid ""
"<p><b><big>Configuration Part Two</big></b><br>\n"
"Press <b>Next</b> to continue.\n"
"<br></p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p><b><big>ການຕັ້ງຄ່າພາກທີສອງ</big></b><br>\n"
"ກົດ <b>ຖັດໄປ</b> ເພື່ອດຳເນີນການຕໍ່.\n"
"<br></p>\n"

#: src/include/slp-server/helps.rb:75
msgid "<p>To show the slpd log file, use <b>Show Log</b>.</p>"
msgstr "<p>ເພື່ອສະແດງໄຟລ໌ລັອກ slpd, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ <b>ສະແດງລັອກ</b>.</p>"

#: src/include/slp-server/helps.rb:78
msgid ""
"<p>Here, set the mode in which to run the SLP daemon. The simplest mode is "
"<b>Broadcast</b>.\n"
"In it, the SLP daemon answers all requests sent by broadcast. The next mode "
"is <b>Multicast</b>. In it, the daemon answers queries\n"
"sent by multicast in appropriate SCOPES. In the <b>DA Server</b> mode, it "
"informs DA servers on the specified IP addresses\n"
"about statically and dynamically registered services. The last options is "
"<b>Becomes DA Server</b>. This is a cache server for service\n"
"answers.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>ຢູ່ນີ້, ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າໂໝດທີ່ຈະໃຫ້ດີມອນ SLP ເຮັດວຽກ. ໂໝດທີ່ງ່າຍທີ່ສຸດແມ່ນ <b>ບຣອດແຄສ</b>.\n"
"ໃນໂໝດນີ້, ດີມອນ SLP ຈະຕອບທຸກການຮ້ອງຂໍທີ່ສົ່ງມາແບບບຣອດແຄສ. ໂໝດຕໍ່ໄປແມ່ນ <b>ມັລຕິແຄສ</b>. ໃນໂໝ"
"ດນີ້, ດີມອນຈະຕອບຄຳຖາມ\n"
"ທີ່ສົ່ງມາແບບມັລຕິແຄສໃນຂອບເຂດ (SCOPES) ທີ່ເໝາະສົມ. ໃນໂໝດ <b>ເຊີເວີ DA</b>, ມັນຈະແຈ້ງໃຫ້ເຊີເວີ "
"DA ຕາມທີ່ຢູ່ IP ທີ່ໄດ້ກຳນົດໄວ້\n"
"ກ່ຽວກັບການບໍລິການທີ່ໄດ້ລົງທະບຽນໄວ້ແບບຄົງທີ່ ແລະ ແບບເຄື່ອນໄຫວ. ຕົວເລືອກສຸດທ້າຍແມ່ນ <b>ກາຍເປັນເຊີເວີ "
"DA</b>. ນີ້ແມ່ນເຊີເວີແຄັດສຳລັບ\n"
"ຄຳຕອບຂອງການບໍລິການ.</p>\n"

#: src/include/slp-server/helps.rb:85
msgid ""
"<p>With <b>Expert Settings</b>, access all options available in /etc/slp."
"conf.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>ດ້ວຍ <b>ການຕັ້ງຄ່າແບບຊ່ຽວຊານ</b>, ທ່ານສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງທຸກຕົວເລືອກທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນ /etc/slp.conf.</"
"p>"

#: src/include/slp-server/helps.rb:88
msgid ""
"Configuration files for static registration to SLP. With <b>Add</b>, create "
"a new empty file. With <b>Modify</b>,\n"
"change the values of any existing file. With <b>Delete</b>, it is possible "
"to delete files not owned by any package."
msgstr ""
"ໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າສຳລັບການລົງທະບຽນແບບຄົງທີ່ກັບ SLP. ໃຊ້ <b>ເພີ່ມ</b> ເພື່ອສ້າງໄຟລ໌ໃໝ່ທີ່ຫວ່າງເປົ່າ. ໃຊ້ "
"<b>ແກ້ໄຂ</b>,\n"
"ເພື່ອປ່ຽນຄ່າຂອງໄຟລ໌ທີ່ມີຢູ່. ໃຊ້ <b>ລຶບ</b> ເພື່ອລຶບໄຟລ໌ທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ເປັນຂອງແພັກເກັດໃດໆ."

